    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041280/extras/23e35209db99177ea407a60b91c8ec9c.avif?t=1726529817\" width=600 height=370 /></span><br><br>Four prisoners on death row are cleared of all charges. But the prison has a quota to meet. The four are put in a room and asked to decide among themselves over the course of an hour... who will be the one to die?<br><br>Prison of Lies is a psychological linear visual novel about lies, trust, and empathy. There are four chapters, each of which get progressively shorter.<br><br>While playing the game, you uncover more about each prisoner.<br><br>It takes approximately half an hour to play.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Original soundtrack<br></li><li>Bios and other extras<br></li><li>Non-linear storytelling</li></ul>",
